        <body>
            <div xml:id="d345">

                <pb facs="0433" n="329" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">733.35/51: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Uruguay (Wright) to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-09-12T16:00:00-03:30">September 12,
                            1932—4 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 4:55 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>53. Diplomatic relations with Argentina resumed today by identic decrees
                    following exchange of notes negotiated by Amezaga, confidential agent of
                    Uruguay. Minister for Foreign Affairs who has shown me texts before publication
                    expresses renewed appreciation of our chargé of Uruguayan interests. Texts by
                    mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wright</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
